## Content Update Workflow

### Adding New Enemy Type (Content-Only)
1. Edit `wipshmup2/config/enemies.json`
2. Add new template entry
3. Validate JSON syntax
4. Test in-game
5. No code changes required!

### Modifying Balance
1. Edit relevant config file
2. Document change reasoning in comments or commit message
3. Playtest the change
4. Iterate as needed

### Versioning Content
```json
{
    "version": "1.2.0",
    "last_updated": "2025-10-18",
    "templates": [
        // ...
    ]
}
```

